<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Good <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">morning/afternoon</span> [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">Client Name</span>],&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">We are transferring you to a Core/Emerging Growth Service Team effective [XYZ DATE] to ensure you are receiving the service most appropriate to your current business needs. You'll now work with a dedicated HR Specialist and a dedicated Client Liaison. They will help you strategize and expand your utilization of Insperity services to further meet your organization's needs while continuing to foster the relationship you and I have established.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">I will update them on any outstanding projects to ensure your new team is up to speed.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Your new Client Liaison will reach out to you in the next several days for a formal introduction. In the meantime, please find new contact information below:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);"><b>Client Liaison Contact Name</b>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">Client Liaison Contact Info</span>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><b>HR Specialist Name</b>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">HR Specialist Contact Info</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Please continue to reach out to me for assistance until <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[XYZ date</span>].&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">It was a genuine pleasure to work with you and I wish you continued success.</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>